lled native matrices or promote Char for those profiles; npm Char has separate installed evidence. The native Char follow-up refreshes source hashes for additive converters and admission checks. Its installed evidence is separate in native-installed-char; historical artifact identities and pre-Char type claims in this record are unchanged. The offline-Composer follow-up refreshes test-source hashes for the pinned Brick Math feed, empty-cache installation and missing-feed regression. Historical artifact identities and type claims are unchanged. The platform-word follow-up refreshes source hashes for additive USize/ISize conversions, compiled-target checks, and shared installed-test harnesses. Its evidence is separate in platform-words-installed; historical artifact identities and type-position claims remain unchanged. Source references refreshed after reviewed primitive callable admission; historical archive identities are unchanged. New callable acceptance is recorded separately in perl-callables-installed. C callable follow-up refreshed source hashes; historical artifact identities and coverage are unchanged. New callable execution evidence is separate. Source digests refreshed after Python callable integration; historical archive identities and coverage remain unchanged. Ruby callable milestone: generator/CI source hashes refreshed; earlier archive identities and installed scopes remain historical. Ruby primitive callable promotion is recorded separately in ruby-callables-installed. Rust callable milestone: generator/CI source hashes refreshed; earlier archive identities and installed scopes remain historical. Rust primitive callable promotion is recorded separately in rust-callables-installed. C++ callable milestone: generator/CI source hashes refreshed; earlier archive identities and installed scopes remain historical. C++ primitive callable promotion is recorded separately in cpp-callables-installed. C/GMP milestone: generator and corpus source hashes refreshed; earlier archive identities remain historical. Fresh GMP evidence is recorded separately in c-gmp-installed. .NET callable milestone: generator and fixture source hashes refreshed; earlier archive identities remain historical. Fresh callable evidence is recorded separately in dotnet-callables-installed. JVM callable milestone: generator and fixture source hashes refreshed; earlier archive identities remain historical. Fresh callable evidence is recorded separately in jvm-callables-installed. Native PHP callable milestone: generator and fixture source hashes refreshed; earlier archive identities remain historical. Fresh callable evidence is recorded separately in php-native-callables-installed. PHP-Wasm callable milestone: generator and fixture source hashes refreshed; earlier archive identities remain historical. Fresh callable evidence is recorded separately in php-wasm-callables-installed. WIT native-callable milestone: shared generator and gate source hashes refreshed; historical archive identities and installed scopes remain unchanged. New WIT callable evidence is recorded separately in wit-wasi-callables-installed. npm callable integration: shared source hashes refreshed; historical archive identities and installed scopes unchanged. See docs/evidence/npm-callables-20260919.md.",
