lled. npm transport staging: shared source hashes refreshed; historical archive identities and installed scopes remain unchanged. See docs/evidence/npm-callable-transport-20260919.md. npm callable integration: shared source hashes refreshed; historical archive identities and installed scopes unchanged. See docs/evidence/npm-callables-20260919.md. GCC 13 frame fix: shared source hashes refreshed without changing historical archive identities or type coverage. See docs/evidence/c-callable-frames-20260919.md. Current companion Kotlin APIs are independently installed and checked in the Kotlin collection receipt; historical archive identities above are retained.",
